# Per-cycle role scratch output. These are regenerated on every role-agent
# cycle and carry no product value. The *intel* families
# (sage-intel-*, scout-intel-*, sage-hypothesis-*, sage-decision-*) are
# deliberately NOT ignored: those are the published research artifacts.
