# Per-cycle probe working files. Only the *final* cycle artifact carries a
# trailing HHMM stamp (e.g. sage-cycle101-index-mechanism.json) and stays
# trackable; every intermediate dump (rows, panel, raw, lanes, mkt*) does not.
sage-cycle*.json
sage-cycle*.html
sage-cycle*.jsonl
sage-cycle*.txt
!sage-cycle*-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].json
!sage-cycle-2026-10-22-*.json
